  "question": {
    "text": "If a line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;is perpendicular to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and the area of the triangle formed by the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;and the coordinate axes is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;sq units, then the distance of&nbsp;the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;from the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>7</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>5</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>1</mn> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;units",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>5</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>7</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;units",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The equation of a line perpendicular to the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Given, line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> is perpendicular to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;hence the equation of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+5</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=0</mo></math></p><p>For finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-Intercept, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-intercept<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></math></p><p>Similarly, for finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>- Intercept, put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-intercept<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Given, the area formed by the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;with the coordinate axes is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;sq units.</p><p>Hence, the area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#916;=</mtext><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=&#177;</mo><mtext>5</mtext><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Hence, the equation of the line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>:&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8289;+5</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8289;&#177;5</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, we know that the distance between the parallel lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus, the distance between the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+5</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=0</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+5</mo><mi>y</mi><mtext>&#8289;&#177;5</mtext><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mn>13</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units.</p>"
  }
}